{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0213_1000_p", "source_sha256": "07bbf527124d9da1fc530530648ecace39c1cec5e1a57954650789ef694e4cee", "ja": "（星梨花が『アイグラ！！』撮影用衣装に着替え中だ。\nそろそろ戻ってくるはずだけど……）", "zh": "（星梨花正在换《アイグラ！！》拍摄用的服装。差不多该回来了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0213_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "a638565af3435fc3a818d97860e10c5feb36b302ef48722dcce1b38cfda551ad", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お待たせしました！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，让您久等了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0213_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7d1b5a02c2565208eda97dbb85b2f86f2ea2a21c733ab1201f06e58e89115afc", "ja": "おかえり、星梨花。\nどうだ、新しい衣装の感想は？", "zh": "欢迎回来，星梨花。\n怎么样，对新服装有什么感想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0213_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "fc77088df16b713784a361b547aacb8bcf088eacde419c29559a1c05d92fc79a", "ja": "はい！　わたし、チャイナ服を着るのは初めて\nなんですけど、すごく体にピッタリしてるんですね！", "zh": "是的！我还是第一次穿旗袍，不过感觉和身体贴合得非常好呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0213_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "47961effa63dbea05a90f284b4d85a84168a66db4e15509950cff14681cc683b", "ja": "それに、かっこよくて……\nなんだか、すこし大人になった気分です♪", "zh": "而且还很帅气……\n总觉得，自己好像也稍微长大了一点♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0213_1005_p", "source_sha256": "68b42c2991f609be5ec5f8dbf8e6463993e7e03f06c729d39709bed3c21f40c9", "ja": "そうか、気に入ったならよかった。\n衣装を選んだ甲斐があるよ！", "zh": "这样啊，喜欢就好。\n看来我挑选服装没有白费功夫！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0213_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "6aa5fc7b643bd4c3d35e6aba7bc851d11dd8b66aeb7e7f2f841423ba04ea12f2", "ja": "はい、とっても気に入りました。\n{$P$}さん、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "好的，我非常喜欢。  \n{$P$}先生，谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0213_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "679d067dc9650d599945250c2a03ad09c10d866a1f07118d0d9cb1aceea3a897", "ja": "あ……そうでした。{$P$}さん、\nひとつ気になったことがあるんですけど……。", "zh": "啊……对了。{$P$}先生，\n我有一件在意的事想问问……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0213_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "5238d5e6d3ac70e3dc5aea5c1ee75316bb926e34a2aafbbf75f1918245e88bf6", "ja": "チャイナ服って、どうして裾のところに\n大きな切れ目が入ってるんでしょう？", "zh": "旗袍为什么要在下摆的位置开那么大的衩呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0213_1009_p", "source_sha256": "436d7debab0240f26616e4239c43d3d8c2a4013228dbdb328d454871e64debb4", "ja": "スリットの事か？\n正式な由来までは知らないけど……。", "zh": "是说开衩吗？  \n我不清楚它正式的由来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0213_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e2ea1c8f74d210a2e6d570d015936ed6e728881992bdb812b8d795bbc76b2e1e", "ja": "今のチャイナ服は、ビジュアル的に映えるから\nスリットを入れてるんだと思うよ。", "zh": "我觉得现在的旗袍会开衩，是因为这样在视觉上更抢眼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0213_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "e372bffe4ae7371dc1af4c4515070211de84003bdf4ccc79bd398fe8e4ea2f45", "ja": "ビジュアル的に映える……？\nあの、それってどういう意味ですか？", "zh": "从视觉效果上更显眼……？\n那个，这是什么意思呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0213_1012_p", "source_sha256": "eccf40c8dd21b16b13bd69fe05daf0c171bd075fd99c7486a545edf413f43759", "ja": "えっと、そうだな……\nスリットがあると、セクシーに見えるというか……。", "zh": "那个，怎么说呢……\n有开衩的话，会显得比较性感……吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0213_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "4a2e5cdf2bc51b2f0470575473dd465eff5c0ce28defcff9be50d5d4d857a4f6", "ja": "セクシー？\nスリットが入っていると、セクシーなんですか？", "zh": "性感？\n有开衩的话，就会显得性感吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0213_1014_p", "source_sha256": "bc3372b9116c896e9b9173797b20ca170bd1e80d78e62725962fe6ad8c94a9ee", "ja": "そうだな。健康的なセクシーというか……。", "zh": "是啊。该怎么说呢，算是健康的性感吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0213_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "e4b2b0d72a32c08c1cb47fa8da0e5081058b204ed6da8c987e0fe497abe2ea5a", "ja": "そうなんですね！　セクシーはわかりませんけど、\nわたし、健康なら自信があります！", "zh": "原来如此！性感什么的我不太明白，不过，说到健康我可是很有自信的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0213_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "7ea5fcf7df892a84f12433089d04b269556e5b7347b70d2f6908ecaeffa8f851", "ja": "ジュニオールとは、毎日お散歩してますし。\nドッグランで、一緒にかけっこしてますから♪", "zh": "我每天都会和朱尼奥尔一起散步。\n还会在狗狗公园里一起赛跑呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0213_1017_p", "source_sha256": "715b987a06485275a830c4d46fc1e72bc49dd96632ed39abce5316c582123c5b", "ja": "はは、そうだな。健康な星梨花が着る\n元気なチャイナ服は、最高の取り合わせかもな！", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。健康的星梨花穿上充满活力的旗袍，说不定是最棒的组合！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0213_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "7d13a7a95cbc51b0d42f5db1cb91cea9dc58b9ba2bbdaae662ef0be301240cad", "ja": "はい！\nそれじゃわたし、元気に撮影してきますね！", "zh": "好的！\n那么我会精神满满地去拍摄啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0213_1019_p", "source_sha256": "10dafcd11dd14de3685abb511b52e38c454f1e6666353bdcb6f9ab79305d5698", "ja": "（その後、星梨花は元気いっぱいで撮影に挑み、\nスタッフの評判も上々だった。完成が楽しみだ！）", "zh": "（之后，星梨花精神满满地投入拍摄，工作人员的评价也非常好。真期待成片啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
